hRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 17:37:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.rand.org/pubs/research_reports/RRA5222-1.html</guid></item><item><title>技术和社会转型时代的政策分析：四个未来和该领域的议程</title><link>https://www.rand.org/pubs/perspectives/PEA5282-1.html</link><description>&lt;p class="desc"&gt;在人工智能驱动的政策分析的分水岭时刻，人工智能削弱了对专家和机构的信任，该领域必须重新审视首要原则，并用它们来指导机构重新设计、政策分析培训和研究治理。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a63231fec7325bd600fce42" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 17:37:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.rand.org/pubs/perspectives/PEA5282-1.html</guid></item><item><title>学校、手机和人工智能：Melissa Kay Diliberti 的问答</title><link>https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/09/schools-cell-phones-and-ai-qa-with-melissa-kay-diliberti.html</link><description>&lt;img height="90" src="https://www.rand.org/content/rand/pubs/commentary/2026/09/schools-cell-phones-and-ai-qa-with-melissa-kay-diliberti/_jcr_content/par/teaser.crop.160x90.lm.jpeg/1790859837557.jpeg" width="160" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p class="desc"&gt;兰德公司副政策研究员 Melissa Kay Diliberti 讨论了兰德公司的最新发现，这些发现可以帮助家长和政策制定者更好地了解学校面临的挑战。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a63231fec7325bd600fce42" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 17:37:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/09/schools-cell-phones-and-ai-qa-with-melissa-kay-diliberti.html</guid></item></channel></rss>